{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Note: Co-op/Multiplayer feature is intended to be added some time after the game makes its debut!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How deep are you willing to go before the light disappears for good?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why\u2019s It Getting DARKER?!</strong> is a first-person psychological survival horror set in a suffocating, pitch-black ocean. You aren't just a researcher; you are prey. Your only connection to the surface is a malfunctioning PDA, a small island, and a darkly sarcastic AI that seems a little too comfortable with your impending doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/c8808d4016f2633e5f7ca0fd96fffa75.avif?t=1774616656\" width=634 height=358 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CORE SURVIVAL FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf8 THE LETHAL CAMERA:</strong> Your camera isn't just for research. Document hostile anomalies to uncover the truth, but remember: looking through the lens means you aren't looking at what\u2019s behind you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca8 OXYGEN IS A PRIVILEGE:</strong> Manage your every breath while they are watching you. In the deep sea, every breath is a countdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd16 A 'HELPFUL' COMPANION:</strong> Navigate the gloom with the guidance of a sarcastic AI assistant of Thalasso Corp. Listen closely - its &quot;glitches&quot; might be the only thing keeping you sane, or the very thing driving you mad. <br><br>&quot;<i>Dying from oxygen? Will be very embarrassing for you&quot;</i> - <strong>AI assistant</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/7ad5d5f25f590b151712665ee1c56965.poster.avif?t=1774616656\" width=1170 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/7ad5d5f25f590b151712665ee1c56965.webm?t=1774616656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/7ad5d5f25f590b151712665ee1c56965.mp4?t=1774616656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd88 UNPREDICTABLE AMBUSHES:</strong> From rarely-seen leviathans to aggressive modified creatures, the ocean's apex predators don't follow a script. They hunt based on your sound, your light, and your fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Development Footages:</i></strong></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/e305f51a2aef956b16509b5d4fa5a396.poster.avif?t=1774616656\" width=1118 height=880 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/e305f51a2aef956b16509b5d4fa5a396.webm?t=1774616656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/e305f51a2aef956b16509b5d4fa5a396.mp4?t=1774616656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/6e16274576849659d6ce0819fd50dc02.poster.avif?t=1774616656\" width=1118 height=880 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/6e16274576849659d6ce0819fd50dc02.webm?t=1774616656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/6e16274576849659d6ce0819fd50dc02.mp4?t=1774616656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/d0725d3fb1429c2dbcef278e1ad9b0d7.avif?t=1774616656\" width=1560 height=710 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NO HANDHOLDING. NO SECOND CHANCES.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a massive underwater world where the threats evolve as the water gets colder and the pressure rises. Fight, flee, or photograph - but every choice consumes time you don't have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The darkness is alive. And it\u2019s angry.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/98968bc6592c437f25ccb043aec65bec.poster.avif?t=1774616656\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/98968bc6592c437f25ccb043aec65bec.webm?t=1774616656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/98968bc6592c437f25ccb043aec65bec.mp4?t=1774616656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Attributions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes 3D assets licensed under CC BY 4.0. Full credit to original creators: &quot;Self Luminous Being&quot; (yanix), &quot;Underwater Creature&quot; (KajaStud), &quot;Bloop&quot; (object), &quot;Snake&quot; (Vasian-Digital3D), &quot;Snatcher&quot; (HighPolyDensity), &quot;Sci-Fi Elevator&quot; (s7ntech), &quot;Cute Alien Tentacle Fish&quot; (Jungle Jim), &quot;Megalodon Retexture&quot; (Sealife Fan 3).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932730?t=1774616656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/113de09c9e3aa640b98bf1160da4b64a417c4076/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774616656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/7c30e05d9d523f50d789d980152b286eafa676e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774616656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/7c30e05d9d523f50d789d980152b286eafa676e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774616656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Why's It Getting DARKER?! contains themes of psychological horror, frightening scenes, and violent encounters with deep-sea creatures. Players may witness disturbing visuals such as blood, creature dismemberment, and intense survival scenarios. While the game does not glorify violence, it includes aggressive behavior from enemies and occasional dark humor via the AI companion. Viewer discretion is advised due to the tense atmosphere and realistic creature behavior that may be unsettling for some players."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Note: Co-op/Multiplayer feature is intended to be added some time after the game makes its debut!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How deep are you willing to go before the light disappears for good?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why\u2019s It Getting DARKER?!</strong> is a first-person psychological survival horror set in a suffocating, pitch-black ocean. You aren't just a researcher; you are prey. Your only connection to the surface is a malfunctioning PDA, a small island, and a darkly sarcastic AI that seems a little too comfortable with your impending doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/c8808d4016f2633e5f7ca0fd96fffa75.avif?t=1774616656\" width=634 height=358 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CORE SURVIVAL FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf8 THE LETHAL CAMERA:</strong> Your camera isn't just for research. Document hostile anomalies to uncover the truth, but remember: looking through the lens means you aren't looking at what\u2019s behind you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca8 OXYGEN IS A PRIVILEGE:</strong> Manage your every breath while they are watching you. In the deep sea, every breath is a countdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd16 A 'HELPFUL' COMPANION:</strong> Navigate the gloom with the guidance of a sarcastic AI assistant of Thalasso Corp. Listen closely - its &quot;glitches&quot; might be the only thing keeping you sane, or the very thing driving you mad. <br><br>&quot;<i>Dying from oxygen? Will be very embarrassing for you&quot;</i> - <strong>AI assistant</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/7ad5d5f25f590b151712665ee1c56965.poster.avif?t=1774616656\" width=1170 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932730/extras/7ad5d5f25f590b151712665ee1c56965.webm?t=1774616656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\